# Parsed as inert text by sync-upstream.sh; never sourced or evaluated.
# KIND|regex matches a complete repository-relative path using Bash EREs.
# Rules must start with ^ and end with $. Escape literal dots with \.
#
# Rule kinds:
#   GENERATED  Machine-written outputs. Merge conflicts in these paths may be
#              resolved by running the generators; the candidate must still
#              verify clean before anything is published.
#   STAGE      Additional paths the sync may stage when the generators
#              rewrite them (side effects on hand-maintained inputs such as
#              go.mod via `go mod tidy`). Conflicts in STAGE-only paths still
#              stop the sync. The staging set is GENERATED plus STAGE.

# Machine-written outputs.
GENERATED|^go\.sum$
GENERATED|^vendor/.*$
GENERATED|^pkg/mcp/testdata/[^/]*\.json$
GENERATED|^README\.md$
GENERATED|^docs/configuration\.md$

# Generator side effects on hand-maintained inputs.
STAGE|^go\.mod$
